@page "/docs/pi"
@layout PublicDocsLayout
<PageTitle>Pi Agent · ARKANA GATEWAY</PageTitle>
<header class="docs-page-header"><div><span class="docs-kicker">Panduan Agent · Pi</span><h1>Pi Agent</h1><p>Pi adalah coding Agent CLI dan toolkit yang mendukung custom provider melalui models.json atau extension.</p></div><span class="docs-agent-mark"><Heroicon Name="cpu-chip" Size="28" /></span></header>
<section class="docs-prose-section"><h2>Status integrasi</h2><p><span class="badge">Conditional</span> Pi mendukung OpenAI-compatible provider, tetapi entry model dan capability metadata harus mengikuti schema Pi versi yang terpasang. Direct Tool-loop Gateway belum ditandai verified pada halaman ini.</p></section>
<section class="docs-prose-section"><h2>Nilai Gateway</h2><div class="docs-definition-list"><div><dt>Base URL</dt><dd><code>https://gateway.arkana.dev/v1</code></dd></div><div><dt>API</dt><dd><code>openai-completions</code> atau <code>openai-responses</code> sesuai model/client</dd></div><div><dt>Model</dt><dd><code>gpt-5.5</code>, jika tersedia untuk Gateway key</dd></div><div><dt>Credential</dt><dd>Environment variable atau <code>~/.pi/agent/auth.json</code></dd></div></div></section>
<section class="docs-prose-section"><h2>Custom provider</h2><p>Pi mendokumentasikan custom provider melalui <code>models.json</code> dan extension. Gunakan schema resmi Pi, isi Base URL Gateway, pilih API mode yang sesuai, lalu deklarasikan model ID dan metadata wajib seperti context window serta output limit.</p><p>Jangan menyalin contoh provider dari versi Pi yang berbeda tanpa mencocokkan dokumentasi resmi.</p></section>
<section class="docs-prose-section"><h2>Verification</h2><ol class="docs-list"><li>Pastikan Pi membaca provider custom.</li><li>Query model catalog Gateway.</li><li>Jalankan text marker.</li><li>Jalankan Tool yang membuat artifact.</li><li>Baca artifact secara independen.</li><li>Periksa Gateway Logs.</li></ol></section>
<section class="docs-callout"><Heroicon Name="arrow-top-right-on-square" Size="21" /><div><strong>Referensi resmi Pi</strong><p><a href="https://github.com/earendil-works/pi">Repository Pi</a> · <a href="https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/blob/main/packages/coding-agent/docs/providers.md">Provider guide</a> · <a href="https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/blob/main/packages/coding-agent/docs/custom-provider.md">Custom provider guide</a></p></div></section>
